{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.y_lambda_recipe_from_partition","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.y_lambda_recipe_from_partition","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Shared.MarkovTraceClaim"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.y_lambda_recipe_from_partition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.y_lambda_recipe_from_partition","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/y_lambda_recipe_from_partition.lean#L39-L53","doc":"**Content statement** (from manuscript):\n\n**Proposition (recipe: $\\lambda \\mapsto y_\\lambda(q)$ as q-rational).**\n*Given a partition $\\lambda \\,\\vdash\\, n$, the Jones-Markov central\ncoefficient $y_\\lambda(q)$ is determined by the following algorithm,\nyielding a rational function in $\\sqrt q$ with cyclotomic\ndenominator.*\n\n    The Lean encoding below states the manuscript claim over a context class and discharges it from the class's fields (§3b-conditional). The declaration type-checks as a complete term; the substantive mathematical content is carried by the context-class axioms, and a full derivation from substrate primitives remains pending. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:y-lambda-recipe-from-partition","label":"prop:y-lambda-recipe-from-partition","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/y-lambda-recipe-from-partition.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.YLambdaRecipeFromPartitionContext.claim_y_lambda_recipe_from_partition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.YLambdaRecipeFromPartitionContext.claim_y_lambda_recipe_from_partition","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/y_lambda_recipe_from_partition.lean#L36-L36","doc":"Manuscript identity: `y_λ(q)` is a q-rational with non-vanishing\ndenominator and equals `num(λ) / denom(λ)`.\n\nThe quotient is written `num · denom⁻¹` through the parent's `invR`:\na generic `CommRing R` carries no `Div`, and at `R = ℝ` this is\ndefinitionally what `num / denom` unfolds to, so the statement is\nunchanged from the previous ℝ-specialised form. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.YLambdaRecipeFromPartitionContext.denom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.YLambdaRecipeFromPartitionContext.denom","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/y_lambda_recipe_from_partition.lean#L28-L28","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.YLambdaRecipeFromPartitionContext.num","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.YLambdaRecipeFromPartitionContext.num","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/y_lambda_recipe_from_partition.lean#L27-L27","doc":"Numerator and denominator of the q-rational representation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.YLambdaRecipeFromPartitionContext.y_lambda","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.YLambdaRecipeFromPartitionContext.y_lambda","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/y_lambda_recipe_from_partition.lean#L25-L25","doc":"Jones-Markov coefficient `y_λ(q)` per partition `λ`, valued in the\ninherited coefficient ring `R` of the parent Markov-trace context\n(§7c: `y_λ(q)` is a q-rational in `√q`, not a real). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.YLambdaRecipeFromPartitionContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.YLambdaRecipeFromPartitionContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/y_lambda_recipe_from_partition.lean#L21-L21","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.YLambdaRecipeFromPartitionContext.toMarkovTraceContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.YLambdaRecipeFromPartitionContext.toMarkovTraceContext","kind":"def","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/y_lambda_recipe_from_partition.lean#L21-L38","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.YLambdaRecipeFromPartitionContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.YLambdaRecipeFromPartitionContext","kind":"class","line":18,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/y_lambda_recipe_from_partition.lean#L18-L38","doc":"Abstract context for the `y_lambda_recipe_from_partition` claim — manuscript-named\ntyped fields below; the `holds` field carries the `Prop`-valued\nclaim of the lemma. ","signatureChunk":0}]}